								<h3 data-staggered-item="">Great powers come with<br> great&nbsp;privacy.</h3>
								<p><strong>Apple&nbsp;Intelligence and Siri&nbsp;AI are designed to protect your privacy at every step.</strong> With powerful on-device processing, Apple&nbsp;Intelligence is aware of your personal information without collecting your personal information. And with groundbreaking Private Cloud Compute, Apple&nbsp;Intelligence can draw on larger server-based models, without making your data accessible to Apple or anyone&nbsp;else.</p>
