						<p>iMac is also available with a <strong>nano‑texture glass option.</strong> This reduces reflections and glare to eliminate distractions while maintaining outstanding image quality. It’s perfect for spaces with challenging lighting conditions — whether you’re near a window or under bright indoor&nbsp;lights.</p>
