										<h3>iPhone Mirroring.</h3>
										<p>See and use what’s on your iPhone from your iMac, without having to reach for it.<sup data-footnote="numbered-iphone-mirroring"><a href="#footnote-10" aria-label="Footnote 6" data-modal-close="">6</a></sup> Move files, photos, and videos between devices as easily as you drag and drop between apps on&nbsp;Mac.</p>
