        <div>
             
                 <h2><strong>A Huge Upgrade with Even More&nbsp;Value</strong>
</h2>
                 
             
                 <div>There’s never been a better time for customers to upgrade from a previous-generation MacBook Pro with Apple silicon or an Intel-based Mac. The 14-inch MacBook Pro with M6 delivers remarkable value thanks to major performance improvements and powerful AI capabilities. The new 14-inch MacBook Pro also features all of the compelling capabilities that have made it so popular, including:
</div>
                 
             
                 <div><ul>
<li><strong>Phenomenal battery life</strong>: In addition to the huge leap in performance, battery life gets up to 14 additional hours for Intel-based upgraders and up to four more hours for users coming from M1, delivering up to 24 hours overall, so users can get more done on a single charge. Users coming from Intel-based and M1 systems will also get 16GB of starting unified memory, an additional Thunderbolt port, and the space black finish with an anodization seal for fewer fingerprints.</li>
</ul>
</div>
                 
             
                 <div><ul>
<li><strong>A brilliant pro display</strong>: The stunning Liquid Retina XDR display delivers up to 1600 nits of peak HDR brightness and a 1,000,000:1 contrast ratio, bringing HDR photos and videos to life with deep blacks, brilliant highlights, and vibrant colors. And for users working in bright or challenging lighting conditions, a nano-texture display option dramatically reduces reflections and glare.</li>
</ul>
</div>
                 
             
                 <div><ul>
<li><strong>Powerful connectivity</strong>: Now with Wi-Fi 7 and Bluetooth 6, the 14-inch MacBook Pro delivers fast wireless performance and low latency, along with support for up to two external displays. Its versatile array of ports — including the HDMI, MagSafe 3, and three Thunderbolt 4 ports; an SDXC card slot; and a headphone jack — makes it easy to connect high-speed peripherals, transfer photos, or expand a workspace.</li>
</ul>
</div>
                 
             
                 <div><ul>
<li><strong>Advanced camera, mics, and speakers</strong>: A 12MP Center Stage camera with Desk View helps keep users perfectly framed on video calls, while a studio-quality three-mic array and amazing six-speaker sound system with Spatial Audio deliver an immersive audio experience.</li>
</ul>
</div>
                 
             
                 <div><ul>
<li><strong>Fast charging</strong>: MacBook Pro with M6 supports fast charging, reaching up to 50 percent charge in just 30 minutes when paired with a compatible higher-wattage USB-C power adapter, such as the 96W Power Adapter.<sup>3</sup></li>
</ul>
</div>
                 
             
                 <div><ul>
<li><strong>A laptop that’s built to last</strong>: With an enclosure made from 100 percent recycled aluminum, MacBook Pro is exceptionally durable and can stand up to everyday use for years to come.</li>
</ul>
</div>
                 
             
                 <div><ul>
<li><strong>Better together with iPhone</strong>: When used together with Continuity, iPhone and Mac are even more powerful — letting users move seamlessly across devices to share files and photos, hand off tasks, and even control their iPhone from their 14-inch MacBook Pro.<sup>5</sup> Users switching to Mac for the first time can use iPhone to conveniently and securely transfer settings, files, photos, passwords, and more.</li>
</ul>
</div>
                 
             
