<li>show uses of a word (<code><a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-uses-of-a-word.html#index-where-_0028-_0022name_0022-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">where</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-uses-of-a-word.html#index-nw-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">nw</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-uses-of-a-word.html#index-bw-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">bw</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-uses-of-a-word.html#index-ww-_0028-u-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">ww</a></code>).</li>
<li>backtraces show source locations and can be browsed
(<code><a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-backtrace-entry-source.html#index-nt-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">nt</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-backtrace-entry-source.html#index-bt-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">bt</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-backtrace-entry-source.html#index-tt-_0028-u-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">tt</a></code>);</li>
<li>and use an editor if desired (<code><a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-source-code-definitions.html#index-edit-_0028-_0022name_0022-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">edit</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-source-code-definitions.html#index-g-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">g</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-uses-of-a-word.html#index-gg-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">gg</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-uses-of-a-word.html#index-whereg-_0028-_0022name_0022-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">whereg</a></code>);</li>
<li>other words:
<code><a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-source-code-definitions.html#index-fancy_002dafter_002dl-_0028-c_002daddr1-u1-lineno1-_002d_002d-c_002daddr2-u2-lineno2-_0029-gforth_002dinternal">fancy-after-l</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-source-code-definitions.html#index-xt_002dlocate-_0028-nt_002fxt-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">xt-locate</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-source-code-definitions.html#index-l-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">l</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-source-code-definitions.html#index-n-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">n</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-source-code-definitions.html#index-b-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">b</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-source-code-definitions.html#index-before_002dlocate-_0028-_002d_002d-u-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">before-locate</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-source-code-definitions.html#index-after_002dlocate-_0028-_002d_002d-u-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">after-locate</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-uses-of-a-word.html#index-ll-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">ll</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-uses-of-a-word.html#index-short_002dwhere-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">short-where</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-uses-of-a-word.html#index-expand_002dwhere-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">expand-where</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-uses-of-a-word.html#index-prepend_002dwhere-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">prepend-where</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Locating-uses-of-a-word.html#index-unused_002dwords-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002d1_002e0">unused-words</a></code></li>
