  AMD64, ARM, IA-64 (Itanium): better performance
  PPC, PPC64: disassembler <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Bitwise-operations.html#index-and-_0028-w1-w2-_002d_002d-w-_0029-core">and</a> <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Assembler-Definitions.html#index-assembler-_0028-_002d_002d-_0029-tools_002dext">assembler</a>
  <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Environmental-Queries.html#index-gforth-_0028-_002d_002d-c_002daddr-u-_0029-gforth_002denvironment">Gforth</a> EC: R8C, 4stack, misc, 8086 work
