<a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Environmental-Queries.html#index-gforth-_0028-_002d_002d-c_002daddr-u-_0029-gforth_002denvironment">Gforth</a> can now deal well with broken pipes <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Word-Lists.html#index-in-_0028-_0022voc_0022-_0022defining_002dword_0022-_002d_002d-_0029-gforth_002dexperimental">in</a> most situations.
