Other: <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Literals.html#index-_005dL-_0028-compilation_003a-n-_002d_002d-_003b-run_002dtime_003a-_002d_002d-n-_0029-gforth_002d0_002e5">]L</a> PUSH-ORDER

Miscellaneous:

Significant extensions <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Values.html#index-TO-_0028-value-_002e_002e_002e-_0022name_0022-_002d_002d-_0029-core_002dext">to</a> the manual (added an introduction, among
  other things), many <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/General-control-structures-with-CASE.html#index-of-_0028-compilation-_002d_002d-of_002dsys-_003b-run_002dtime-x1-x2-_002d_002d-_007cx1-_0029-core_002dext">of</a> them due <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Values.html#index-TO-_0028-value-_002e_002e_002e-_0022name_0022-_002d_002d-_0029-core_002dext">to</a> a <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Basic-Mini_002dOOF-Usage.html#index-new-_0028-class-_002d_002d-o-_0029-mini_002doof">new</a> team member: Neal Crook.
Added assemblers <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Bitwise-operations.html#index-and-_0028-w1-w2-_002d_002d-w-_0029-core">and</a> disassemblers <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Counted-Loops.html#index-FOR-_0028-compilation-_002d_002d-do_002dsys-_003b-run_002dtime-u-_002d_002d-loop_002dsys-_0029-gforth_002d0_002e2">for</a> 386, Alpha, MIPS (thanks <a href="https://gforth.org/manual/1.0/Values.html#index-TO-_0028-value-_002e_002e_002e-_0022name_0022-_002d_002d-_0029-core_002dext">to</a>
