            <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:18:05 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://corridorkey.com/">https://corridorkey.com/</a>, See on <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50251127">Hacker News</a></p>
<div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div id="top"><section><h2>THE BEST KEYING TOOL <br><strong>AVAILABLE TO ALL</strong></h2><p>Perfect keys are now one click away. CorridorKey 2.0 (CK2.0) removes the struggles of working with green and blue screens, solving even the hardest keys with one click - all while running locally in your VFX/editing program of choice. Resolve, Nuke, After Effects, Premiere, Blender - one purchase gets you EVERY plugin. NO SUBSCRIPTION.</p><div><figure data-compare=""><div><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="https://corridorkey.com/_astro/mars-before-1920.B9gFrBX5.avif 1920w, https://corridorkey.com/_astro/mars-before-1280.LyFvYEVs.avif 1280w, https://corridorkey.com/_astro/mars-before-750.A6U4QCm7.avif 750w" sizes="(max-width: 1120px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px"><img src="https://corridorkey.com/_astro/mars-before-1280.AS10jOXl.jpg" alt="Before: a performer in a rainbow wig, sheer veil and blue gloves, shot against a green screen" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="https://corridorkey.com/_astro/mars-after-1920.CE-5uJ0u.avif 1920w, https://corridorkey.com/_astro/mars-after-1280.DmQpf8CT.avif 1280w, https://corridorkey.com/_astro/mars-after-750.pCv3Wzrc.avif 750w" sizes="(max-width: 1120px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px"><img src="https://corridorkey.com/_astro/mars-after-1280.VKbRJmCp.jpg" alt="After: the same performer keyed onto a rocky landscape under an orange-to-blue sky" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div></figure></div></section><div><p><img src="https://corridorkey.com/brand/corridor-wordmark.svg" alt="Corridor Digital" width="450" height="75" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p><p>This is Corridor Digital’s first official plugin release. After the success of CorridorKey 1.0, we teamed up with <a href="https://github.com/alexandremendoncaalvaro" rel="noopener" aria-label="Alê Alvaro on GitHub">Alê Alvaro</a> (plugin development) and <a href="mailto:z.brooks.harris@gmail.com" aria-label="Zachary Harris by email">Zachary Harris</a> (model design and training) to make CorridorKey accessible in every software package.</p></div><section id="hosts"><h2>Buy once.<br>Key everywhere.</h2><p>CorridorKey is ready for YOUR favorite software. CorridorKey is supported on Windows and NVIDIA GPUs.</p><div><div><h3>DaVinci Resolve</h3></div><div><h3>Nuke</h3></div><div><h3>After Effects</h3></div><div><h3>Premiere Pro</h3></div><div><h3>Blender</h3></div></div><ul><li>Windows</li><li>Mac</li></ul></section><section id="standalone"><h2>Standalone app included</h2><p>The best tool for bulk shots. We built CorridorKey for the production of <em>Son of a Dungeon</em>, where over 400 VFX shots went through this app. See it in action when it premieres on November 7. <u>Included</u> in your purchase.</p></section><section id="features"><h2>Production tested.<br>Professional output.</h2><ul><li><span>Native 4k (and higher!)</span></li><li><span>HDR support</span></li><li><span>Floating point color depth.</span></li><li><span>Eliminates flicker</span></li><li><span>Works on <u>any</u> color background</span></li><li><span>Runs on <u>your</u> machine</span></li></ul><p>CorridorKey 2.0 is the de facto keying tool used internally at Corridor. We have not used another keying tool in over six months as nothing else comes close to our results with CK2.0.</p></section><section id="unmixing"><h2>Solve the “un-mixing” problem</h2><p>CorridorKey does something no other tool does - it predicts the color of semi-transparent foreground objects, intelligently removing the background screen color. This gives you perfect motion blur, bokeh, and hair. And unlike other tools, CorridorKey 2.0 has <strong>time awareness</strong>, eliminating flicker and chattering mattes by analyzing the entire video, not just one frame.</p><p><u>Now even a wrinkled blanket and an iPhone can produce high-quality results.</u></p></section><section id="how-to-use"><h2>Simple to use</h2><div><div><h3>Apply the node</h3><p>Using CorridorKey is a one click process for most shots. You simply apply the plug-in and it will understand the difference between your background and your subject.</p></div><div><h3>Process time awareness</h3><p>For enhanced quality, you can run “time awareness” on a shot, which analyzes the whole video clip in order to more effectively separate the background from the foreground. This eliminates the chattering from issues like compression and noise, and it helps preserve ultra-fine details like hair.</p></div><div><h3>Provide a hint</h3><p>For full control over what’s included or excluded from your shot, simply provide a single black-and-white image or video.</p></div></div></section><section id="control"><h2>Total artistic control</h2><p>CorridorKey lets the artist dictate what to key, with easy to use AlphaHint inputs. Tracking markers, edges of the screen, and c-stands no longer require garbage masking. You can provide one rough guide frame, or a whole guide video, and CorridorKey understands what you want to keep.</p></section><section id="pricing"><div><h2>Buy it once. Own it.</h2><p>Corridor believes artists should be able to own their tools.</p></div><div><div><p><span>Personal</span></p><div><p><span data-price="">$61.88</span><span>one time</span></p><!-- Task 0100/0106: a etiqueta de imposto. "incl. ..." onde o preco mostrado inclui o imposto do pais; "plus tax where applicable" com pais desconhecido (worker/consumer-tax.js). --><p><span data-tax-label="">incl. VAT</span><span data-was="">$123.75</span></p></div><div data-urgency=""><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 7v5l3 2M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0z" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><p><span>Beta price. Goes back to <b data-urg-full="">$123.75</b> on <span data-beta-regular-label="">November 21</span>.</span></p></div><ul><li><span>✓</span><span>Every host surface: <b>Resolve, Nuke, After Effects, Premiere, Blender</b></span></li><!-- 2026-10-21 (Jared no Discord, Mac sem o plugin Adobe): o que o Mac traz, a frase que o Ale aprovou em 2026-10-20 palavra por palavra (src/lib/host-answer.test.js). --><li><span>✓</span><span>On Mac, you get the standalone app, the OpenFX plugin, the Blender add-on and, since 2.0.0.146, the After Effects and Premiere Pro plug-in.</span></li><li><span>✓</span><span><b>One person</b>, up to <b>2 machines</b> on one activation</span></li><li><span>✓</span><span>Move a machine yourself, <b>no support ticket</b></span></li><li><span>✓</span><span>Lifetime updates on the <b>2.x</b> line</span></li><li><span>✓</span><span><b>14-day money-back guarantee</b>, no questions asked</span></li></ul><!-- So aparece com a compra travada (pre-launch ou a chave de vendas do /admin), pelo checkout-config. Texto aprovado pelo Ale em 2026-10-17. --><!-- Task 0085: so no modo Stripe so-EUA, para quem esta fora dos EUA (checkout-config.buyerCountryAllowed).
           PROPOSTA de texto, ainda sem o OK do Ale nas palavras exatas: o modo so-EUA nao vai ao ar sem esse OK. --><!-- Aparece quando o checkout nao abre (Paddle fora do ar, bloqueado, ou checkout.error). Texto aprovado pelo Ale em 2026-10-16. --><!-- Os requisitos completos moram num bloco so, gerado do manual (Hardware.astro), na mesma pagina (2026-10-22). Task 0168
           (GROUND-0151): debaixo do Buy, a frase que o Ale aprovou palavra por palavra em 2026-10-24 ("aprovado", item 49), porque
           compradores em AMD, Linux e Mac Intel nao viram o requisito (GROUND-0150); requirements-pages.test.js trava o texto. --><p>Needs a Windows PC with an NVIDIA RTX graphics card, or an M-series Mac on macOS 14 or newer. It doesn't run on Intel Macs, and AMD graphics and Linux aren't supported yet. <a href="#hardware">See the hardware requirements.</a></p></div><div><p><span>Studio</span></p><p><span>$</span><span data-studio-price="">42.50</span><span>per seat</span><span data-studio-was="">$85.00</span></p><p>5 to 24 seats · volume pricing · 25+ negotiated</p><div data-studio-urgency=""><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 7v5l3 2M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0z" stroke="var(--brand)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><p><span>Founder pricing per seat. Back to <b data-studio-full="">$85.00</b> on <span data-beta-regular-label="">November 21</span>.</span></p></div><ul><li><span>✓</span><span>One license for the whole team: <b>5 to 24 seats</b>, one machine per seat</span></li><li><span>✓</span><span>Reassign seats across the team anytime</span></li><li><span>✓</span><span>Central billing, one invoice</span></li><li><span>✓</span><span>Priority support channel</span></li></ul><p><a href="https://help.corridorkey.com/support/?type=studio">Talk to us</a></p></div></div><p>One-time purchase · 2 machines · 14-day money-back guarantee, no questions asked</p><!-- Task 0106: o Worker poe aqui o checkout-config deste visitante (worker/price-ssr.js); o script o le sem fetch. --><p data-beta-note=""><span>BETA</span> <span>Founder pricing is pre-applied at checkout, no code to remember. Optional code <b data-beta-code="">CK2BETA</b> if you have it. Beta price offer runs through <span data-beta-ends-label="">November 20</span>. Code expires on its own.</span></p></section><section id="hardware"><h2>Hardware Requirements:</h2><ul><li><strong>GPU:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 30 series or newer (recommended)</li><li><strong>RTX 20 series (beta):</strong> works in our tests so far, still being validated</li><li><strong>GPU memory:</strong> 4 GB for shots up to 1440p. 6 GB for 4K.</li><li><strong>System:</strong> Windows 11, or Windows 10 22H2</li><li><strong>Mac:</strong> M-series, macOS 14 or newer</li><li><strong>AMD GPUs:</strong> planned</li><li><strong>Linux:</strong> planned</li></ul></section></div></div>]]></description>
